{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-73437" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ if $f(x)=\\sqrt{x}-2arccscx.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73437" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x}-2arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-2(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73437" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-73437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{1}{2x\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{2}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{1}{2|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73437" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341104" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve $y=2x+arccotx$ at $x=0.$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341104" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arccot$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x+arccotx) \\\\  & =2+(-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =2-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent to the curve at $x=0$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m={y}^{′}(0) & =2-\\frac{1}{1+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & =2-1 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341104" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-341104" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341104" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312358" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $f(x)=\\text{arccot }x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1),$ calculate ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312358" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $\\text{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccot }x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccot }x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}+\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x-1}{{x}^{2}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312358" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-312358" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312358" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{2x-1}{x^2+1}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110517" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ if $f(x)=2\\sqrt{x}+5arccscx.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110517" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\sqrt{x}+5arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+5\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+5(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110517" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-110517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2x}}+\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110517" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110510" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the slope of the tangent line to the curve $f(x)=-7arccscx$ at $x=\\sqrt{5}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110510" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-7arccscx) \\\\  & =-7\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=f(x)$ at $x=\\sqrt{5}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(\\sqrt{5}) & =\\frac{7}{|\\sqrt{5}|\\sqrt{{\\sqrt{5}}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{5}\\sqrt{5-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{2\\sqrt{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110510" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-110510" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110510" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{2}{5\\sqrt{7}}"] ["math" "\\frac{2}{7\\sqrt{5}}"] ["math" "\\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{7}}"] ["math" "\\frac{7}{2\\sqrt{5}}"] ["math" "\\frac{7}{5\\sqrt{2}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110510" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{7}{2\\sqrt{5}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312364" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve $f(x)=5arcsec({x}^{2}+3)$ at $x=2.$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312364" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arcsec$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arcsec\\,x)=\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5arcsec({x}^{2}+3)) \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{1}{|{x}^{2}+3|\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+3)^{2}-1}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}+3) \\\\  & =5\\cdot \\frac{1}{|{x}^{2}+3|\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+3)^{2}-1}}\\cdot (2x) \\\\  & =\\frac{10x}{|{x}^{2}+3|\\sqrt{({x}^{2}+3)^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve at $x=2$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m={f}^{′}(2) & =\\frac{10(2)}{|{2}^{2}+3|\\sqrt{({2}^{2}+3)^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{20}{|7|\\sqrt{49-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{20}{7\\sqrt{48}} \\\\  & =\\frac{20}{7\\cdot 4\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{7\\sqrt{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{21}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312364" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-312364" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312364" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{5}{7\\sqrt{3}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-32000" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=2arccsc(8-{x}^{4}).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-32000" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $\\text{arccsc}$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccsc}\\,x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2arccsc(8-{x}^{4})) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccsc(8-{x}^{4})) \\\\  & =2(-\\frac{1}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(8-{x}^{4}) \\\\  & =2(-\\frac{1}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}})\\cdot (-4{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{8{x}^{3}}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-32000" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-32000" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-32000" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{12{x}^{3}}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "-\\frac{4{x}^{3}}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{12{x}^{3}}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{6{x}^{3}}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{8{x}^{3}}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-32000" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{8{x}^{3}}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341121" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve $f(x)=arccsc(\\sqrt{x})$ at $x=2.$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341121" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccsc\\,x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[arccsc(\\sqrt{x})] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{|\\sqrt{x}|\\sqrt{{(\\sqrt{x})}^{2}-1}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\sqrt{x}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}\\sqrt{x-1}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2x\\sqrt{x-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve at $x=2$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m={f}^{′}(2) & =-\\frac{1}{2\\cdot 2\\sqrt{2-1}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341121" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-341121" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341121" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{1}{4}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341115" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve $f(x)=arcsec({e}^{x})$ at $x=\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡10.$\n\n$m=$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341115" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arcsec$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arcsec\\,x)=\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[arcsec({e}^{x})] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{|{e}^{x}|\\sqrt{{({e}^{x})}^{2}-1}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{e}^{x}\\sqrt{{e}^{2x}-1}}\\cdot {e}^{x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{e}^{2x}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent line to the curve at $x=\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡10$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m={f}^{′}(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡10) & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{e}^{2(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)/2)}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{e}^{\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341115" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-341115" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341115" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{1}{3}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-31903" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find the slope of the tangent line to the function $y=arcsec({x}^{3}-6x)$ at $x=1.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-31903" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arcsec$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arcsecx)=\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arcsec({x}^{3}-6x)) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{|{x}^{3}-6x|\\sqrt{({x}^{3}-6x)^{2}-1}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3}-6x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{|{x}^{3}-6x|\\sqrt{({x}^{3}-6x)^{2}-1}}\\cdot (3{x}^{2}-6) \\\\  & =\\frac{3{x}^{2}-6}{|{x}^{3}-6x|\\sqrt{({x}^{3}-6x)^{2}-1}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line to the curve at $x=1$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(1)\\text{ } & =\\frac{3(1)^{2}-6}{|{1}^{3}-6(1)|\\sqrt{({1}^{3}-6(1))^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-3}{|-5|\\sqrt{(1-6)^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5\\sqrt{24}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5\\sqrt{4\\cdot 6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5\\cdot \\sqrt{4}\\cdot \\sqrt{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5\\cdot 2\\cdot \\sqrt{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{10\\sqrt{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3\\sqrt{6}}{10\\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\sqrt{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3\\sqrt{6}}{60} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{20}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-31903" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-31903" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-31903" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{10}"] ["math" "-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{20}"] ["math" "-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{5}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{10}"] ["math" "\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{20}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-31903" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{20}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341146" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)={e}^{x}\\cdot arccot\\,x.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)={e}^{x}\\,arccot\\,x\\,-$\n{{field-1}}" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341146" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arccot$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x}\\cdot arccot\\,x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})\\cdot arccot\\,x+{e}^{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot\\,x) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}\\,arccot\\,x+{e}^{x}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}\\,arccot\\,x-\\frac{{e}^{x}}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341146" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-341146" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-341146" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{e^x}{1+x^2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-2484" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=arccscx\\cdot arcsecx$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-2484" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formulae for the derivatives of $arccsc$ and $arcsec$ are\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx) & =-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}, \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arcsecx) & =\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formulae above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =arcsecx\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccscx)+arccscx\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arcsecx) \\\\  & =arcsecx\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})+arccscx\\cdot (\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{arcsecx}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{arccscx}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{arccscx-arcsecx}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-2484" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-2484" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-2484" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{2arccscx}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{2arcsecx}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{2x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{arccscx+arcsecx}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "\\frac{arccscx-arcsecx}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-2484" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{arccscx-arcsecx}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110817" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡xarccot{x}^{3}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110817" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $\\text{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccotx)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule, the formula above and the chain rule, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡xarccot{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccot{x}^{3})+arccot{x}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{1+{({x}^{3})}^{2}})+arccot{x}^{3}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{arccot{x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110817" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-110817" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110817" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{arccot3{x}^{2}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{3}}"] ["math" "\\frac{arccot3{x}^{2}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}"] ["math" "\\frac{arccot{x}^{3}}{x}+\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1-{x}^{3}}"] ["math" "\\frac{arccot{x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}"] ["math" "\\frac{arccot{x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1-{x}^{6}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110817" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{arccot{x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-19065" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=({x}^{3}+2x)arccotx.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-19065" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arccot$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccotx)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(({x}^{3}+2x)arccotx) \\\\  & =arccotx\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3}+2x)+({x}^{3}+2x)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccotx) \\\\  & =arccotx\\cdot (3{x}^{2}+2)+({x}^{3}+2x)\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =(3{x}^{2}+2)arccotx-\\frac{{x}^{3}+2x}{{x}^{2}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-19065" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-19065" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-19065" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "(3{x}^{2}+2)-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}"] ["math" "(3{x}^{2}+2)arccotx-\\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+1}"] ["math" "(3{x}^{2}+2)arccotx-\\frac{{x}^{3}+2x}{{x}^{2}+1}"] ["math" "arccotx-\\frac{({x}^{3}+2x)(3{x}^{2}+2)}{{x}^{2}+1}"] ["math" "arccotx-\\frac{{x}^{3}+2x}{{x}^{2}+1}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-19065" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "(3{x}^{2}+2)arccotx-\\frac{{x}^{3}+2x}{{x}^{2}+1}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110791" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot arccsc{x}^{2}$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110791" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $arccsc$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccsc{x}^{2}) & =-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(arccsc{x}^{2})+arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (-\\frac{2x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}})+arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\  & =arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110791" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-110791" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110791" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "arccscx\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}"] ["math" "arccscx\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}"] ["math" "arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}"] ["math" "arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}"] ["math" "arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110791" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "arccsc{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73447" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{arccotx}{x}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73447" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we let $u(x)=arccotx$ and $v(x)=x$, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\cdot x-arccotx\\cdot 1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{x}{1+{x}^{2}}-arccotx}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{(\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{1+{x}^{2}})}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73447" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-73447" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73447" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{1+{x}^{2}arccotx}{1+{x}^{2}}"] ["math" "-\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}"] ["math" "-\\frac{{x}^{2}+arccotx}{1+{x}^{2}}"] ["math" "\\frac{(1+x)arccotx}{x(1+{x}^{2})}"] ["math" "\\frac{arccotx}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73447" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{x+(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{2}(1+{x}^{2})}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73448" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{arccscx}{{e}^{3x}-1}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73448" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we let $u(x)=arccscx$ and $v(x)={e}^{3x}-1$, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=3{e}^{3x}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\cdot ({e}^{3x}-1)-arccscx\\cdot 3{e}^{3x}}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{3{e}^{3x}arccscx}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73448" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-73448" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73448" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{1}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{3{e}^{3x}arccscx}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}"] ["math" "-\\frac{3}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{{e}^{3x}arccscx}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}"] ["math" "-\\frac{{e}^{3x}-1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{3arccscx}{{e}^{3x}({e}^{3x}-1)}"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{{e}^{3x}|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{{e}^{3x}arccscx}{{e}^{3x}-1}"] ["math" "\\frac{3}{{e}^{3x}|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+\\frac{{e}^{3x}arccscx}{{e}^{3x}-1}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-73448" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{1}{({e}^{3x}-1)|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}-\\frac{3{e}^{3x}arccscx}{({e}^{3x}-1)^{2}}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312391" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}+5}{arcsec\\,x}.$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} \n$\\frac{1}{arcsec\\,x}\\,-$\n\n{{field-2}} \n$\\frac{1}{|x|{arcsec}^{2}\\,x}$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312391" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we let $u(x)={x}^{2}+5$ and $v(x)=arcsec\\,x,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=2x\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2x)\\cdot arcsec\\,x-({x}^{2}+5)\\cdot \\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}}{(arcsec\\,x)^{2}}. \\\\  & =2x\\,\\frac{1}{arcsec\\,x}-\\frac{{x}^{2}+5}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\frac{1}{|x|{arcsec}^{2}\\,x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312391" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-312391" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312391" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2x"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312391" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-312391" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{x^2+5}{\\sqrt{x^2-1}}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110834" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{arccscx}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110834" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we let $u(x)={x}^{2}+4x$ and $v(x)=arccscx,$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=2x+4\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2x+4)\\cdot arccscx-({x}^{2}+4x)\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})}{{arccsc}^{2}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x+4}{arccscx}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110834" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-110834" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110834" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\frac{2x+4}{arccscx}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}"] ["math" "\\frac{2x+4}{arccscx}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}"] ["math" "\\frac{4x+2}{arcsecx}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}"] ["math" "\\frac{x+4}{arccscx}-\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}"] ["math" "\\frac{{x}^{2}+4}{arccscx}-\\frac{2x+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110834" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{2x+4}{arccscx}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {arccsc}^{2}x}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110786" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{arccotx}{{x}^{3}}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110786" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we let $u(x)=arccotx$ and $v(x)={x}^{3},$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=3{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\cdot {x}^{3}-arccotx\\cdot 3{x}^{2}}{({x}^{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{1+{x}^{2}}-3{x}^{2}arccotx}{{x}^{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{(\\frac{{x}^{3}+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}arccotx}{1+{x}^{2}})}{{x}^{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{x}^{3}+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}arccotx}{{x}^{6}(1+{x}^{2})} \\\\  & =-\\frac{x+3(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110786" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "217f5299ae314c7f80ddc7488b16a4271316a30ab53c3aeca2bfd17b852b0491"} {"question" "q-110786" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110786" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-\\frac{2x+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}"] ["math" "-\\frac{x+3(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}"] ["math" "-\\frac{{x}^{2}-4(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}"] ["math" "\\frac{2x+3{x}^{2}arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1-{x}^{2})}"] ["math" "\\frac{x-(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{2}(1-{x}^{2})}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "q-110786" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-\\frac{x+3(1+{x}^{2})arccotx}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/state.json" "file_sha256" "ff79be7737b00de3a20e7bd1d25d76fea278417df2cbd7219b56f89f10c747c6"} {"question" "e-207" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Calculate $\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}y}{\\textrm{d}x}$ if $y = 2 \\,\\textrm {arccot } x.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/example-207.json" "file_sha256" "a95aa089ac7f7c435677de3a068e647b792b55e6a38077fb3bc6bf8ecb07a434"} {"question" "e-207" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $\\textrm{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\textrm {arccot } x) \t=  -\\dfrac 1 {1+x^2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\,\\text{arccot }x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccot }x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{1+{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/example-207.json" "file_sha256" "a95aa089ac7f7c435677de3a068e647b792b55e6a38077fb3bc6bf8ecb07a434"} {"question" "e-210" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Find $f'(x)$ if $f(x) =2 \\, \\textrm {arccot } (x^2 + 5).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/example-210.json" "file_sha256" "42801f46ccf60b6f1770fe39b4d4de8c2ed21b926e32b4a0c12e4dd9754ac950"} {"question" "e-210" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $\\textrm{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\textrm {arccot } x) \t=  -\\dfrac 1 {1+x^2}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\,\\text{arccot }({x}^{2}+5)) \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{1+({x}^{2}+5)^{2}})\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}+5) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{1+({x}^{2}+5)^{2}}\\cdot 2x \\\\  & =-\\frac{4x}{1+({x}^{2}+5)^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4x}{{x}^{4}+10{x}^{2}+26}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/example-210.json" "file_sha256" "42801f46ccf60b6f1770fe39b4d4de8c2ed21b926e32b4a0c12e4dd9754ac950"} {"question" "e-209" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $f(x) =3 x\\, \\textrm {arccsc }x,$ calculate $f'(x).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/example-209.json" "file_sha256" "5a84a74d90b152b2147a9da850560042ed3450e911fa9cee7cb082bf1cd4533d"} {"question" "e-209" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The formula for the derivative of $\\textrm{arccsc}$ is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\textrm {arccsc } x) \t=  -\\dfrac 1 {|x| \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}} \\, .\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3x\\,\\text{arccsc }x) \\\\  & =3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x\\,\\text{arccsc }x) \\\\  & =3(x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\text{arccsc }x)+\\text{arccsc }x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)) \\\\  & =3x(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})+3\\,\\text{arccsc }x\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-\\frac{3x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}+3\\,\\text{arccsc }x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/example-209.json" "file_sha256" "5a84a74d90b152b2147a9da850560042ed3450e911fa9cee7cb082bf1cd4533d"} {"question" "e-208" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $f(x) = \\dfrac{\\textrm{arcsec } x}{\\textrm{arccsc } x},$ calculate $f'(x).$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/example-208.json" "file_sha256" "6858309135332952287562ade49d2566012b654332e303f5eee77834d9014628"} {"question" "e-208" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Here, we let $u(x) = \\textrm{arcsec } x$ and $v(x) = \\textrm{arccsc } x$, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\nu'(x) =  \\dfrac 1 {|x| \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}}\t\\quad \\text{and} \\quad\tv'(x) = -\\dfrac 1 {|x| \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\cdot \\text{arccsc }x-\\text{arcsec }x\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})}{{\\text{arccsc }}^{2}x} \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}})\\frac{\\text{arccsc }x+\\text{arcsec }x}{{\\text{arccsc }}^{2}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{arccsc }x+\\text{arcsec }x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}{\\text{ arccsc }}^{2}x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13979671/example-208.json" "file_sha256" "6858309135332952287562ade49d2566012b654332e303f5eee77834d9014628"}] "usage" {"e-209" [] "q-32000" [] "e-208" [] "e-207" [] "e-210" []} "basis" 909 "retractions" [[17592186115658 :question/problem "Calculate $f^{′}(x)$ for $f(x) = 2\\arccsc(8 - x^{4})$."] [17592186114865 :question/problem "Calculate $\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}y}{\\textrm{d}x}$ if $y = 2 \\,\\textrm {arccot} x$."] [17592186114865 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $\\textrm{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\textrm {arccot} x) = -\\dfrac 1 {1+x^2}\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\frac{dy}{dx} &= \\frac{d}{dx}(2arccotx) \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(arccotx) \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot (-\\frac{1}{1 + x^{2}}) \\\\\n&=-\\frac{2}{1 + x^{2}}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186114874 :question/problem "Find $f'(x)$ if $f(x) =2 \\, \\textrm {arccot} (x^2 + 5)$."] [17592186114874 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $\\textrm{arccot}$ is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\textrm {arccot} x) = -\\dfrac 1 {1+x^2}\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf^{′}(x) &= \\frac{d}{dx}(2arccot(x^{2} + 5)) \\\\\n&= 2 \\cdot (- (1)/(1 + (x^{2} + 5)^{2})) \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(x^{2} + 5) \\\\\n&= - (2)/(1 + (x^{2} + 5)^{2}) \\cdot 2x \\\\\n&= - (4x)/(1 + (x^{2} + 5)^{2}) \\\\\n&=-\\frac{4x}{x^{4} + 10x^{2} + 26}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186114872 :question/problem "If $f(x) =3 x\\, \\textrm {arccsc}x$, calculate $f'(x)$."] [17592186114872 :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $\\textrm{arccsc}$ is\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d}{\\textrm d x}(\\textrm {arccsc} x) = -\\dfrac 1 {\\mid x \\mid \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}} \\,\n$$\n\nUsing the product rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf^{′}(x) &= \\frac{d}{dx}(3xarccscx) \\\\\n&= 3\\frac{d}{dx}(xarccscx) \\\\\n&= 3(x \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(arccscx) + arccscx \\cdot \\frac{d}{dx}(x)) \\\\\n&= 3x(-\\frac{1}{\\mid x\\begin{vmatrix}\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}) + 3arccscx \\cdot 1 \\\\ =-\\frac{3x}{\\mid x\\end{vmatrix}\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} + 3arccscx\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [17592186114869 :question/problem "If $f(x) = \\dfrac{\\textrm{arcsec} x}{\\textrm{arccsc} x}$, calculate $f'(x)$."] [17592186114869 :question/worked-solution "Here, we let\n\n$$\nu(x) = \\textrm{arcsec} x\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\nv(x) = \\textrm{arccsc} x\n$$\n\n, and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\nu'(x) = \\dfrac 1 {\\begin{vmatrix}x & \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}} \\quad \\text{and} \\quad v'(x) = -\\dfrac 1 {\\mid x\\end{vmatrix} \\sqrt {x^2 - 1}}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf^{′}(x) &= (u^{′}(x) \\cdot v(x) - u(x) \\cdot v^{′}(x))/([v(x)]^{2}) \\\\\n&= (\\frac{1}{\\begin{vmatrix}x & \\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}} \\cdot arccscx - arcsecx \\cdot (-\\frac{1}{\\mid x\\end{vmatrix}\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}}))/(arccsc^{2}x) \\\\\n&= (\\frac{1}{\\mid x\\begin{vmatrix}\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}})\\frac{arccscx + arcsecx}{arccsc^{2}x} \\\\ = \\frac{arccscx + arcsecx}{\\mid x\\end{vmatrix}\\sqrt{x^{2} - 1}arccsc^{2}x}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"]] "immutable_answers" [17592186113349 17592186113350 17592186113351 17592186113352 17592186113353] "immutable_fields" [[17592186113348 :answer-field/correct] [17592186113348 :answer-field/id] [17592186113348 :answer-field/key] [17592186113348 :answer-field/type]] "no_history" []}
